.TH AD_PIPELINE 1 "2026-08-30" "ad 2.0" "ad pipeline"
.SH NAME
ad_pipeline \- run the full ad animation pipeline (compute, postprocess, pace, animate)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ad_pipeline
.RI [ options ]
.I <oldfile> <newfile>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ad_pipeline
is the end-to-end pipeline driver. It runs all four stages:
.PP
.RS
.nf
1. compute     — ad_compute (C++; Perl fallback)
2. postprocess — ad_postprocess (layer orchestrator)
3. pace        — ad_layer_pace (C; Perl fallback)
4. animate     — ad (C; Perl fallback)
.fi
.RE
.PP
Options are routed by prefix:
.TP
.B \-\-compute\-*
Options for ad_compute (e.g. \-\-compute\-algorithm patience)
.TP
.B \-\-postprocess\-*
Options for ad_postprocess (e.g. \-\-postprocess\-indent\-last)
.TP
.B \-\-pace\-*
Options for ad_layer_pace (e.g. \-\-pace\-delete\-pacing word)
.TP
.B \-\-animator\-*
Options for ad (e.g. \-\-animator\-no\-display, \-\-animator\-speed 2.0)
.PP
Unprefixed options (e.g. \-\-speed, \-\-no\-display) go to the animator.
.SH OPTIONS

.SS Direct Options

.TP
.B \-\-no\-display
Process without rendering (write snapshot only). Passed to the animator.

.TP
.BI \-\-speed\  N
Speed multiplier (0.5=half, 2=double, 5=5x). Passed to the animator.

.TP
.BI \-\-snapshot\  FILE
Write final buffer to FILE. Passed to the animator.

.TP
.BI \-\-output\  FILE
Alias for
.BR \-\-snapshot .
Passed to the animator.

.TP
.B \-\-indent\-last
Enable the indent_last postprocess layer (shorthand for
.BR \-\-postprocess\-indent\-last ).

.TP
.B \-\-overwrite
Enable the overwrite postprocess layer (shorthand for
.BR \-\-postprocess\-overwrite ).

.TP
.B \-\-line\-delete\-in\-place
Enable the line_delete_in_place postprocess layer (shorthand for
.BR \-\-postprocess\-line\-delete\-in\-place ).

.TP
.BI \-\-ad\-layer\  NAME\fR[:\fIARGS\fR]
Add a layer to the postprocess chain. Repeatable. Layer args follow the
colon (colons or spaces as separators). See
.BR ad_postprocess (1).

.TP
.BI \-\-ad\-layer\-path\  DIR
Add a directory to the layer search path. Repeatable.

.TP
.B \-\-list\-layers
List available layers and exit (delegates to
.BR ad_postprocess (1)).

.TP
.B \-\-syntax
Generate syntax colormap files for the animator (via
.BR ad_colorize ).
Usually auto-detected; rarely needed directly.

.TP
.B \-\-scroll\  zz|zt|zb|none
Passed to the animator. Scroll cursor to center/top/bottom/none.

.TP
.B \-\-diff\-stat
Passed to the animator. Show diff stat overlay.

.TP
.B \-\-diff\-highlight
Passed to the animator. Highlight modified lines.

.TP
.B \-\-bell
Passed to the animator. Ring bell on errors.

.TP
.B \-\-line\-numbers
Passed to the animator. Show line numbers in the margin.

.TP
.B \-\-progress
Passed to the animator. Show progress bar at bottom.

.TP
.B \-\-verbose
Show timing info on stderr.

.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Show what would be animated without running.

.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
Show help and exit.

.SS Prefix-Routed Options

The following prefixes route options to a specific pipeline stage by
stripping the prefix and passing the remainder (with
.B \-\-
prepended) to that stage. For example,
.B \-\-postprocess\-ad\-layer\-arg=LAYER:ARG
becomes
.B \-\-ad\-layer\-arg=LAYER:ARG
when passed to
.BR ad_postprocess .

.TP
.B \-\-compute\-*
Pass through to
.BR ad_compute (1).
Example:
.B \-\-compute\-word\-diff

.TP
.B \-\-postprocess\-*
Pass through to
.BR ad_postprocess (1).
This is how you reach
.BR \-\-ad\-layer\-arg ,
.BR \-\-ad\-layer\-profile ,
.BR \-\-ad\-layer\-dry\-run ,
.BR \-\-ad\-layer\-keep\-temps ,
.BR \-\-ad\-layer\-passthrough ,
etc. Example:
.B \-\-postprocess\-ad\-layer\-profile

.TP
.B \-\-pace\-*
Pass through to
.BR ad_layer_pace (1).
Example:
.B \-\-pace\-delete\-pacing\ word

.TP
.B \-\-animator\-*
Pass through to
.BR ad (1).
Example:
.B \-\-animator\-no\-display
.SH CONFIGURATION
No environment variables. Use CLI flags or the config file at
$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ad/config (defaults to ~/.config/ad/config).
.PP
Precedence: /etc/ad/config < ~/.config/ad/config < CLI flags.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B ad_pipeline old.py new.py
Run the full pipeline with defaults.
.TP
.B ad_pipeline --no-display --speed 5 --snapshot out.txt old.py new.py
Run fast, write result to out.txt.
.TP
.B ad_pipeline --indent-last --pacing gaussian old.py new.py
Enable indent_last and gaussian pacing.
.TP
.B ad_pipeline --ad-layer=my_custom_layer old.py new.py
Add a custom layer to the chain.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ad_vim (1),
.BR ad_postprocess (1),
.BR ad_compute (1),
.BR ad (1)
